{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "Bug hunting across the IRC Fiber APPLICATION containers (engine / gateway / holder / ircd). Framework containers (loki, grafana, promtail, caddy, mongo, redis, cloudflared) are excluded — their internal log noise (plugin re-registration, query cancellation, WAL recovery, scheduler RPC) overwhelms the real signal. For per-container health see the Container Health dashboard.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": true,
  "panels": [
